ts of \\(S_n\\) that were covered by \\(L\\) remain covered, and no new point is lost; the total number of lines stays \\(n\\) while the number of sunny lines decreases by one.  \nRepeating this operation yields configurations for every integer \\(k\\) with \\(0\\le k\\le k_{\\max}\\).\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------\n#### 6.  Conclusion  \n\nThe admissible numbers of sunny lines are exactly those listed in the boxed statement of the summary. ∎"
